        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 895MD, Traditional Scroll Lever with Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Omnia made lever set includes a traditional scroll style lever with round rose. Omnia makes quality hardware that you know will last and install beautifully. It is available in single dummy, double dummy, passage and privacy functions. Both the single dummy and the double dummy functions feature concealed surface mounting for easy installation. The passage and privacy functions are available for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets and the two functions are packaged for both 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors. The Prodigy Scroll Leverset is perfect for traditional decors. Available in 7 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Scroll Lever With Modern Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n<li>28° rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-installation.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 895MD Scroll Lever With Modern Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary lever for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary lever for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, privacy button, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Door Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Prodigy Scroll Leverset, Omnia 895MD",
                "description": "Prodigy Scroll Leverset, Omnia 895MD - This Omnia made lever set includes a traditional scroll style lever with round rose. Omnia makes quality hardware that you know will last, install beautifully, and look great for many years to come. It is available in single dummy, double dummy, passage and privacy functions. Both the single dummy and the double dummy functions feature concealed surface mounting for easy installation. The passage and privacy functions are available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and the two functions are packaged for both 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch thick doors. The Prodigy Scroll Leverset is perfect for traditional decors. Available in 7 finishes.",
                "keywords": "OMN-895MD, OMNIA 895MD, Scroll Lever With Modern Round Roses, Prodigy Scroll Leversets, privacy levers, passage levers, solid brass levers, omnia prodigy collections, wave levers, traditional leversets, classic leversets,"
